'''Wugtrio''' (Japanese: '''ウミトリオ''' ''Umitrio'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

