==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paradox Rift|Wugtrio|53}} from the {{TCG|Paradox Rift}} expansion.
*'''Triple Whip''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Battle Styles|Carnivine|9}} from the {{TCG|Battle Styles}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

